    "text": "If <math><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></math>, then the truth values of <math><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>r</mi></math> are respectively, (where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></math>)",
