  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that the conditional statement&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></math>&nbsp;only when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></math>&nbsp;when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></math></p><p>Again, we know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></math>&nbsp;when both&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;are false.</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
